      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "CINEMATIC (2) has a fair record and proved too classy last time to win by 3.5 lengths at this track in a handy 17.40 beating LENNY LIMES. Has a very good strike-rate from this draw, with three wins from four starts. Can measure up again. COMPTON COPY (7) hit the ground running off the low draw last start and was never headed (22.87) at this track in a Other over 400m. One of the key runners again. LENNY LIMES (1) is progressing well with another good run last time, placing (17.63) last time out at this track. Has a good record here at this journey. Reliable out of the boxes and should take advantage of the inside draw. Expected to be in the finish again. COMPTON STELLA (8) is in form and worth thought again.",
